refactor: organize logs by application layer

CATEGORY: Infrastructure / DevOps

DESCRIPTION:
- Reorganized logs directory structure to categorize logs by application layer
- Created dedicated directories for each component: apphost, gateway, services (per microservice), shared, and general
- Improves log discoverability and troubleshooting by layer

CHANGES:
- Created hierarchical log structure under app/server/logs/
- Each microservice has dedicated log folder
- API Gateway logs in dedicated gateway/ folder
- Shared infrastructure logs in shared/ folder
- General system logs in general/ folder
- All directories remain excluded from git via .gitignore

IMPACT:
- Better log organization for easier debugging and monitoring
- Clearer separation of concerns by architecture layer
- No impact on application code or runtime behavior
